# Launches the escape capsule: C, held from the launch tunnel so that the first frame in space reads it, leaves
# the Cobra behind (the rear view watches it go), and 80 frames later the capsule is back at Lave's station.
# It starts from escape-pod.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the reference's own save with an escape capsule.
file JAMESON.CDR escape-pod.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # the disc menu
key l; wait 0.3                    # Load Commander: it asks for a file name
key j; key a; key m; key e; key s; key o; key n; key Return; wait 0.5
digest loaded 810355dcb4c337685f69a0c9ec481993c210f081b1593adb3eabe7285ec72249
picture loaded 44fd17ae02fbc25fb600d728cb324d04ff3a9ca1e4d3c452baf2feb4e9d0a706
key F1; wait 0.5                   # launch
down c; wait 1; up c               # the capsule, on the first frame in space
digest ejected a10e2a8f5fb413518519e9d39f0c6b4e539afee95c852ecaec56cb08501e8716
picture ejected 8d8302d868bca82fc640052cb7aedab41b9e3470188e63fbbdc89b06dbeabb09
wait 2
digest in-the-capsule 1c429f2e4b87d0e2ba8967fb9a4f47328035f21f4740a9cde7e2f46a701d3e78
picture in-the-capsule 8a86c3b139762581120d2cd35a2f955a0768e6d50bf74254d01cd8bf778d950a
wait 2                             # the capsule docks, and the status screen shows the capsule gone
digest rescued 76fafef6796223736cde00a507dc0eac0beb50f1789f1a885f08c9815840f9b8
picture rescued 5f681d095973410bfa163b956f0ef09a30129a94ed1f7499533e58dfe2e1d548
